<title>BELGIUM: Tractebel sells Swiss Coditel stake.</title>
<headline>Tractebel sells Swiss Coditel stake.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian Coditel SA, a subsidiary of utility holding firm Tractebel, said on Thursday it sold its minority stake in its Swiss namesake Coditel to Sece Cortaillod Holding, giving Tractebel a capital gain of about 175 million Belgian francs.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6815, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
